\newlabel{fig:lso-convergence}{{5.5}{40}{Median retained best-so-far \vertpos {} over requested candidate slots for the fifteen fixed LSO configurations. The three panels correspond to latent EA, CEM, and CMA-ES. Dispersion is omitted to keep the five checkpoint trajectories in each panel legible. The horizontal axis is a requested-slot count, not the number of unique simulator evaluations}{figure.5.5}{}}
